# Every endpoint of the canteen system, ready to click.
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and the IntelliJ HTTP Client.
# Start the system first:  ./mvnw -q package -DskipTests && docker compose up -d --build --wait
#
# Real clients use only the gateway (port 8080). The 808x "debug" ports talk to one
# service directly, which is handy for actuator endpoints and Swagger UI.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@menu = http://localhost:8081
@customers = http://localhost:8082
@orders = http://localhost:8083

### ---------- Menu (menu-service) ----------

### List the whole menu
GET {{gateway}}/api/menu

### Batch read: several items in one request
GET {{gateway}}/api/menu?ids=1,3,6

### One item
GET {{gateway}}/api/menu/1

### Unknown item -> 404 problem detail
GET {{gateway}}/api/menu/999

### Add an item -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{gateway}}/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Idli", "price": 30.00, "available": true}

### Invalid item -> 400 with an "errors" map
POST {{gateway}}/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "price": -5}

### Replace an item (use the id returned above)
PUT {{gateway}}/api/menu/7
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Idli (2 pcs)", "price": 35.00, "available": true}

### Delete an item -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/menu/7

### ---------- Customers (customer-service) ----------

### Register a customer -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{gateway}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Asha", "email": "asha@campus.edu"}

### Same email again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{gateway}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Asha again", "email": "asha@campus.edu"}

### List customers
GET {{gateway}}/api/customers

### One customer
GET {{gateway}}/api/customers/1

### ---------- Orders (order-service, which calls the other two) ----------

### Place an order -> 201 Created, total 140.00
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 1, "items": [{"menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 2}, {"menuItemId": 3, "quantity": 1}]}

### Unknown customer -> 422
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 999, "items": [{"menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1}]}

### Sold-out item (Mango Lassi) -> 422
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 1, "items": [{"menuItemId": 6, "quantity": 1}]}

### Invalid order -> 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 1, "items": [{"menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 0}]}

### List orders
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders

### One order
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/1

### ---------- Operations (debug ports) ----------

### Circuit breaker state: CLOSED, OPEN or HALF_OPEN
GET {{orders}}/actuator/circuitbreakers

### The last circuit breaker events (successes, errors, state changes)
GET {{orders}}/actuator/circuitbreakerevents

### Health of each service
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{menu}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{customers}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{orders}}/actuator/health

### The gateway's routes
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/gateway/routes

### OpenAPI description of a service (Swagger UI: open {{orders}}/swagger-ui.html in a browser)
GET {{orders}}/v3/api-docs
